A||||17||Archie||Very Interesting..Two Events Collide||||1||
Z||000000||Archie||04-14-2001||12:53 AM||||As many know Bob Steiger @ Twin Lake Fiero & NIFE are putting on the Fiero Fest 2001 on 5-5-01 at Bob's place in Paxton, IL starting at 10AM.<P>Many people are also aware that Hot Rod Magazine is putting on it's annual "Power Tour" event. This year Power Tour starts in Pontiac, MI on 5-3-01 and heads West from there. The Drive actually starts on 5-4-01.<P>I have been researching Power Tour to see if I can run a leg or two and still make it to Bob's event in Paxton, IL.<P>Well what do you know.... on the 2nd. day of driving the 1st fuel stop is at 11:30 AM in PAXTON, IL, I-57 Exit 261. I was at Bob's yesterday and I happen to know that you can actually see I-57 from certain points on his property. <P>We all know that at least a couple Fieros are planning to run in the Power Tour, & I feel it would be a shame if we didn't attempt some kind of interaction between the 2 groups who are to collide in the same small town at the same time.<P>Your thoughts.<P>Archie <P> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jimmy||04-14-2001||01:13 AM||||This would be SWEET!  I am probably going to hitch a ride to Bob's with KEV from MFF.  This would be a lot of fun if some more people/cars could make a quick stop.  To bad I can't make it to your V8 Seminar.  Oh well I should have my V8 done soon.  See ya there.<P>Jim  ||||reg||1
