Z||000015||Archie||05-04-2001||09:36 PM||||Ok, this whole thing appears to be getting a life of it's own.<P>I've just returned from 2 days with the Power Tour and I can tell you that everyone from Hot Rod Magazine, Hot Rod TV & Kit Car have expressed interest in the NIFE attempt to meet up with the Power Tour.<P>If you were not planning to go to Bob's tomorrow or if you were going and not planning to join us to meet up with the Power Tour, please reconsider.<P>We really need to get a big turnout to meet the Tour as they come thru.<P>We will be handing out flyers at Bob's detailing the plan we have put together. we've handed copies of these flyers to Editors from Hot Rod & Kit Car and these guys actually read them.<P>Now all we have to do is get a good turnout so that I don't have to hide my head in the sand.<P>All the photoguys with the Power Tour know what mile marker to start looking for us at so make sure you smile & wave.<P>I'd like to thank Phil for helping me get the word out at the Power Tour the last 2 days.<P>Archie<BR>See you tomorrow.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000016||Archie||05-05-2001||10:04 PM||||Well we did it!!!!! We had 36 Fieros alongside the Highway as the Power Tour Cars (and Phil) came thru.<P>I've been making promises for the last week or so to the Hot Rod Magazine & Hot Rod TV that we'd have 30 to 40 cars out to welcome them. I'm sure that this is the largest group that has greeted them so far. We saw the camera Trucks go by and they were shooting film. Looks like all the talking and planning  was successful. <P>Thanks to a phone call from Phil our timing was great. We had just parked our cars along the Hwy. when they (the camera trucks) came thru.<P>I'd like to thank everyone who participated. With all the promises I had made to the Tour people, I was a bit worried that I'd have to hide my head in the sand if no one showed up.<P>Thanks all.<P>Archie<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-093s.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-094s.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000017||Dave Gunsul||05-06-2001||01:02 PM||||That was some great work Archie.<BR>It was a lot of fun too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I hope they will show/write something in the<BR>mag. about us.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
